Claude Desktop macOS Simplified Chinese Generator

Translation data source:
https://github.com/ICERainbow666/claude-desktop-zh-cn

Special thanks to ICERainbow666 and the claude-desktop-zh-cn community for
maintaining the Simplified Chinese translation files used to build the local
dictionary.

This repository independently implements a local generator that checks an
official Claude.app and, only after explicit confirmation, creates a separate
localized copy. It never modifies, re-signs, backs up, restores, or otherwise
writes files inside the official Claude.app. It does not redistribute Claude
Desktop and is not affiliated with Anthropic.

The generated copy uses local temporary ad-hoc signing and is not an
Anthropic Developer ID signed or notarized application. Gatekeeper, Cowork,
Claude Code, and other official installation checks can report it as an
invalid installation. Gateway/API Key configurations can also place the copy
in 3P (third-party) / Cowork mode with unavailable mode controls.
